  g  <  ESC-<       *  Go to first line in file (or line _N).
  G  >  ESC->       *  Go to last line in file (or line _N).
  p  %              *  Go to beginning of file (or _N percent into file).
  t                 *  Go to the (_N-th) next tag.
  T                 *  Go to the (_N-th) previous tag.
  {  (  [           *  Find close bracket } ) ].
  }  )  ]           *  Find open bracket { ( [.
